== Icelandic ==
===Etymology===
From ''[[verða]]'' (meaning "to [[need]]") + ''[[að#Icelandic|að]] [[fara#Icelandic|fara]]'' (meaning "to [[go]]" + ''[[núna]]'' (meaning "[[now]]"). Literally meaning "to need to leave now".
=== Phrase ===
'''[[verða#Icelandic|verða]] [[að#Icelandic|að]] [[fara#Icelandic|fara]] [[núna]]'''

# to [[need]] to leave now, to need to go now

